patch+++ holds the complete series generated with git format-patch from the
vendor import commit, together with an index that explains each change and the
verification state, and the progress write-up now records why the elevator never
moved: the clock controller on this board is gcc-sdmmagpie, whose GP clock table
lacks the low frequencies the chopper needs, so clk_set_rate(32000) on
gcc_gp2_clk left the pin at 19.2 MHz.  With the factory table restored the pin
runs at 32000 Hz and the front camera raises normally.

